    "published": "2025-08-07",
    "first_seen": "2026-07-30",
    "summary": "- Added force_refresh parameter for Assessment (#4183). The assessment workflow has been enhanced with the introduction of a force-refresh parameter, allowing users to forcefully rerun the assessment and obtain new results, even if it was previously run. This parameter, which defaults to false, provides users with more control over the assessment workflow, enabling them to manually trigger a refresh of the assessment data when needed. The force-refresh parameter can be set to true to overwrite existing results, and its usage is optional, allowing users to choose when to refresh the assessment data. The addition of this parameter modifies the behavior of the assessment workflow, which previously would not update the output of previously run assessments. With this update, users can now force a complete refresh of the assessment data, which can be useful in scenarios where the assessment results need to be recalculated. However, users are advised to use this option with caution, as the process can be time-consuming and resource-intensive for large workspaces.…",
    "category": "Platform Overview",
    "tags": [
      "databrickslabs/ucx"
    ]
  },
